This project is a desktop GUI wrapper. It does not implement graph
extraction, clustering, query, or visualization itself - all of that
comes from the `graphifyy` package by Safi Shamsi:

    https://github.com/safishamsi/graphify
    https://pypi.org/project/graphifyy/

`graphifyy` is installed as a runtime dependency by the OS-specific
installer scripts. It is not redistributed by this repository.

